WEBVTT

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.670
We have a new singing competition champion!

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.030
Who'll be our next challenger?

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.530
No need to register!

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.130
We'll do it!

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:20.720
Those are...

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.550
We will challenge...

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.160
...the champion!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.230
Tsubasa-san, those are...

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:17.280
Yeah, but what are they thinking?

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:21.250
Hibiki, do you know them?

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.000
Yeah. Um, Miku...

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:28.610
They're Symphogear-wielders, who declared war

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:31.670
on the entire world, with whom we've fought.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.480
Then they're with Maria-san?

00:02:34.950 --> 00:02:37.650
The girl who was controlling 
Noise at the concert hall?

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:39.930
Yeah, but...

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:46.180
<b>Episode 5 
Bloodstained Serenade</b>

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:03.620
Each time you use your power,

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.450
Finé's soul awakens more.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:10.500
That means she's erasing your own soul.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.380
That cannot happen.

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.630
We'll do it.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:19.380
Protecting Maria is our fight!

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.100
Do you regret it?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.550
I'm fine, Mom...

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:32.870
I shall fulfill the task given to me.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:38.320
This time, it's pursuers from our home country.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.450
They found this place already?

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.290
Even with heretical technology,

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.570
we are still a group of amateurs.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:51.330
That we could escape trained professionals 
would be too much to hope for.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.690
What do we do?

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:56.370
We strike before they get inside.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.160
Maria, eliminate them.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.260
Eliminate them...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.960
They're just normal people!

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.950
One hit from Gungnir, and...

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.440
And that's what I'm telling you to do.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:12.530
It was the same during the concert broadcast.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:17.290
Maria, are you afraid of staining 
your hands with blood?

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:19.930
Mom, I...

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:41.290
Kiri-chan, our goal is...

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:46.570
To steal the pendants made from relic fragments!

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:49.300
Then you don't have to do it this way.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.060
I've heard that if you win this contest,

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.350
they'll grant you a wish.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.560
We can't let this chance slip—

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.560
Fine! If you want to fight, I'm ready!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.990
I'll go along with you this once.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.320
But don't forget. This is—

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.480
I know.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.580
I'll make sure it goes great!

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.500
Resolve yourself to this, Maria.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:18.170
Now let's hear you sing! Um...

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.590
Tsukuyomi Shirabe.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.340
Akatsuki Kirika!

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.520
Okay!

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.690
Let's hear you sing "Orbital Beat."

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.350
Of course that's a Zwei Wing song!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.300
This song!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.610
It's Tsubasa-san and Kanade-san's...

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:35.850
What are they trying to do?

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.680
Is this supposed to be a provocation?

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.960
It's begun.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.170
Go, Maria!

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:54.120
<i>Even a billion prayers,</i>

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:57.370
<i>even the gentlest light...</i>

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:03.880
<i>Everything is swallowed up 
by a dark, jail-like evil.</i>

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.560
<i>Like karma,</i>

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.130
<i>rolling ever onward...</i>

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.760
<i>I just can't give it up.</i>

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:15.300
<i>So now I'll run forward, staying true to myself!</i>

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:22.440
<i>Reach higher, reach higher, my burning 
heart, connected to a rising pulse.</i>

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:28.950
<i>Stronger, stronger, simply staring 
at the Sirius within my heart.</i>

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:33.950
<i>Crossing over the darkness...</i>

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.690
<i>Even the entangling noise,</i>

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.890
<i>even the freezing silence...</i>

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.590
Carbonization?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:49.840
<i>Your heartbeat erases it all, like a carol.</i>

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:51.960
<i>More than betraying,</i>

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.580
<i>more than being hurt,</i>

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:56.220
<i>I wanted to live pure.</i>

00:06:56.220 --> 00:07:01.550
<i>But now I let that dream sleep!</i>

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.070
Dr. Ver?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.780
I know I am, perhaps, overstepping my bounds.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.470
But there's no need to use

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:05.980
the reborn Finé's Gungnir on opponents like these.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:09.800
<i>Paranoia shattered when these hands, 
these hands overlapped.</i>

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.240
I'll deal with them.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:15.870
<i>These memories playing a passionate, 
a passionate refrain.</i>

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:21.760
<i>On the other side of life!</i>

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.630
Tsubasa-san?

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:59.540
Why do fellow singers

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.520
have to fight one another?

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.590
Is this where that huge noise was coming from?

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.720
It's probably construction or something, right?

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.710
If we don't get to practice, 
Coach will get mad...

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.450
Oh?

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:22.700
Don't do it, Ver...

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:25.020
They have nothing to do with this!

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:27.470
Don't do it!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:39.140
Their lovely voices just might knock

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:41.160
the champion off her throne.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:44.040
We'll have to see what the judges say!

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.570
Two on one, huh? Fine...

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.920
Our hideout has been located.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.710
We were able to repel the attackers,

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:56.430
but now that they know our location, 
we can't stay here long.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:58.880
We're going to move,

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.430
so let's meet at the point I'm about to send.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.820
But...

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:06.180
We might get the pendants soon!

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:08.860
This is an emergency. 
Obey the orders you've been given.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.790
Okay, the judges have given their scores—

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:15.860
H-Hey!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.900
You're running away?

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:18.740
Shirabe!

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.240
I think it'll be okay, since Maria's there.

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:24.300
But I'm worried.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.060
We'll chase them, Tachibana!

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:32.420
You stay here, Miku.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:36.030
We might have to fight them.

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:37.350
O-Okay.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:44.190
Hibiki... I knew it. This isn't...

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.120
Damn it! What do we do?

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:12.640
Kirika-chan and Shirabe-chan, right?

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.210
Three versus two.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.890
You have the advantage of numbers.

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:21.100
But think about what you'll lose

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:24.300
if you fight here.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.980
You're going to play dirty like that?

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:31.760
You looked like you were having 
so much fun, singing like that...

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.420
I just don't want to fight here.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.890
I know! A duel!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:41.530
I demand an official duel!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.740
Why?

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.610
There's no reason we have to fight 
every time you meet us, right?

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:48.080
Whose side are you on?!

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:52.370
We'll tell you when the duel is to be.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.210
So...

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.800
Are you three together?

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.100
We've detected a Noise-materialization pattern.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.100
It vanished shortly afterward.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.230
But just in case, we'll investigate 
the surrounding area.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.140
Right.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:14.460
Right.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.650
<i>An abandoned hideout,</i>

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:29.710
<i>and the bodies of multiple Noise victims.</i>

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:33.940
<i>It's different than before, 
but what does it mean?</i>

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:34.810
Commander...

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:38.880
The analysis is back from 
the Nagata Deep Computing Lab.

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.400
Displaying on monitor.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.890
Matching aufwachen waveform.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:47.190
The error bar is below a trillionth of a percent.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:53.580
Maria Cadenzavna Eve's black Gungnir is

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:57.190
one-hundred-percent identical to Hibiki-kun's?

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:01.820
It's the same as mine?

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:05.040
The only possibility I can think of

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:09.450
is that, when Ryouko-san was working 
with the US, she took part of Gungnir

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:11.830
and used it to make that.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.170
Another Gungnir Symphogear,

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.740
made using the Sakurai Theory.

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:19.880
But it's strange.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:24.090
The US government was after Finé's research.

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:28.850
If they have this FIS group and have 
even made a Symphogear,

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:31.100
they shouldn't need it.

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:33.490
Given the fact that

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:36.360
it's out of their control, running wild,

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:40.980
we can assume FIS kept tight control of the 
technology and relic-related information,

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:44.110
and is acting on its own.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:51.820
What is FIS trying to do that's so important,

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:54.340
they'd fight their own government?

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:07.680
<i>Pursuers from the US have 
finally caught up with us.</i>

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:11.680
<i>But the Nephilim is still growing.</i>

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.960
<i>We're a long way from activating Frontier.</i>

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.380
<i>To carry on Serena's will,</i>

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.840
<i>you were supposed to have 
accepted everything, Maria.</i>

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.290
<i>There is no time left for uncertainty!</i>

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.590
The Nephilim's output remains unstable.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:50.000
I was right. It's impossible to control a relic

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:53.460
if you force boot it without a song.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.840
I'll sing.

00:13:58.630 --> 00:14:00.410
But that song...

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:06.570
My Climax Song may be able to reset the Nephilim

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.570
to its pre-activation state.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.470
But that's a gamble!

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:13.330
If even that fails...

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:19.020
If that happens, you'll deal with it, Maria-neesan.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.590
The people from FIS are here, too.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:23.710
It isn't only me.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:25.710
So it'll work out.

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.310
Serena...

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:31.970
I didn't want the power to wear a Gear,

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:36.710
but I am the one who wanted 
to use it to protect everyone.

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:40.050
Serena!

00:14:56.050 --> 00:15:04.130
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:12.510
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el Balal zizzl.</i>

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:35.330
<i>The apple floated in the sky.</i>

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.610
Serena!

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.040
Serena!

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:44.250
<i>The apple fell down to the ground.</i>

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.000
Someone! My sister...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.580
A valuable experimental sample destroyed itself?

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.790
Experiments aren't free!

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:43.430
You incompetents!

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:45.440
Why are you saying that?

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:48.820
<i>The stars were born.</i>

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:49.590
My sister's the one shedding blood to protect you!

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:53.490
<i>The songs were born.</i>

00:15:53.490 --> 00:16:02.590
<i>The Lulu Amel smiled for eternity.</i>

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:07.250
<i>The stars kissed.</i>

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:05.980
I'm glad, Maria-neesan...

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.250
Serena...

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:11.450
<i>The songs slept.</i>

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:08.990
Serena!

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:21.070
<i>Where will they call home?</i>

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.720
Serena!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:30.820
<i>Where will they call home?</i>

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:26.820
<i>Serena, unlike yours,</i>

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:30.820
<i>my songs may not be able to protect anyone.</i>

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:35.620
We'll be arriving at the rendezvous point shortly.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:36.640
Understood?

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.140
Okay, Mom.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:52.240
Maria!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.530
Are you okay?

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:55.920
Yes.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:16:59.180
I'm so glad.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.010
If Finé awakens inside you,

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:04.190
we won't be able to see you.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:07.320
Even if I become Finé's vessel, I'll still be me.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.090
Don't worry.

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:14.400
I'm glad you're both safe.

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:18.070
Now, let's go before they catch up.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:19.550
Wait, Mom!

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.470
We didn't get the pendant!

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.880
We can't just leave!

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:27.630
We promised we'd have a duel—

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:28.940
Mom—

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:31.980
Stop messing around!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.510
Maria and you two, as well,

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:36.990
this battle is not a game!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.150
That's enough.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:42.750
The situation isn't beyond recovery yet.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.000
Right?

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.500
And the promise they made, this duel...

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.200
I want to be part of it.

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.260
Detecting a Noise-materialization pattern!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:56.160
Classic...

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.260
A smoke signal to call us to the duel?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.620
Location identified.

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:00.960
It's...

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:01.760
What is it?

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:05.740
The special sealed zone, inside Tokyo.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.240
The Kadingir Ruins?!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:15.980
The perfect place

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:18.250
to finish things, huh?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:24.790
You...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:37.130
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:07.660
<i>Clenched fists, 1000% thunder.</i>

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:12.420
<i>Unleash everything you've got. Three, two, one, zero!</i>

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:18.020
<i>Take the shortest way, an unwavering line.</i>

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:22.040
<i>To share with you... Burst it...</i>

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.400
<i>To reach you!</i>

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.560
Where are Shirabe and Kirika-chan?

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.050
They're in a timeout.

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:33.060
So I'm here instead.

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:36.120
I can't have them trying to be friends,

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.710
and messing up the plan.

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:41.200
What is FIS plotting?!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.640
Plotting?

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.480
That's a rude way of putting it.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:48.200
Our goal is humanity's salvation!

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:53.960
We're trying to save as many innocent lives as 
possible from being lost to the falling Moon.

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:54.980
The Moon?

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:57.170
For the past three months,

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.860
every nation in the world has been 
tracking the Moon's orbit!

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.840
If they'd found something, they—

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:04.350
Of course they wouldn't tell anyone.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:08.960
It's a massive disaster, with no solution.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:11.730
Telling people would just invite further chaos.

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:15.080
There are thousands of reasons to hide

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.400
an inconvenient truth.

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:21.280
Don't tell me the people who know about this

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.360
are trying to set it up, so only they'll survive?

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.620
Then what would you do?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.860
Our answer is

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:32.370
the Nephilim!

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.340
Chris-chan!

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:39.370
Yukine!

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:43.520
This thing won't...

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.310
Bring people together, form an organization,

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:48.350
build a country, and protect their lives.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:51.100
That is what we'll use the Nephilim's power for!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.320
<i>Resound, resound, my heart!</i>

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:01.150
<i>Sing passionately, my heart!</i>

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:02.360
Hero of the Lunar Attack,

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.260
<i>It's all right, everything is just fine.</i>

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.520
what do your fists protect?

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:05.590
<i>Because I made sure I was ready for this!</i>

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:08.080
<i>Even if my life withers away,</i>

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.760
<i>the warmth when we hold hands</i>

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.540
<i>leaves something, shares something.</i>

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.870
<i>Looking up at the future,</i>

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:20.880
<i>stand strong, and believe 
you'll be born as a flower!</i>

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:23.300
Even as you use your fists to protect someone,

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:27.250
you're killing even more people!

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:29.560
That's what I mean by hypocrisy.

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:44.070
Tachibana!
